  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ba398dc87565ae34685c80a74190cc0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Senior Level
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Do you prefer to communicate using email, over the phone or in-person?
      Why?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: What are some skills you still want to learn?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How do you lead and motivate others?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How do you handle work/life balance?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Describe your leadership style.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How would you handle an underperforming employee?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: "How do you evaluate your team members\u2019 performance?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How do you deal with change and uncertainty?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How do you handle conflict and feedback?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: What attributes does your ideal manager possess?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Tell me about the last training session you've been a part of. What area
      were you working to improve?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: What skills have you developed the most in your recent position?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: What assistance do you typically receive from others you work alongside?
      How integral is having support and a shared workload to your success?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Tell me about a time when you disagreed with a colleague and how you resolved
      the issue.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: As a leader, how do you deal with difficult colleagues?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Describe a time when you balanced short-term results with long-term strategy.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Tell me about a decision involving moral or ethical trade-offs.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How do you mentor and develop emerging talent?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: What has been your process for integrating feedback loops in complex teams?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Describe managing organizational resistance to change.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: What metrics do you use to evaluate your leadership success?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Tell me about resolving team conflict using motivational interviewing or
      empathetic leadership.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How do you promote innovation and creativity in your team?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Describe how you influence people with conflicting agendas.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Give an example of a time you solved a problem in a creative way.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Tell me about a decision you made and later changed your mind on.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Describe leading a project where you used different leadership styles.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: How do you maintain good working relationships with colleagues?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Tell me about your biggest achievement as a leader.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  - text: Describe a time when you showed integrity and professionalism under pressure.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26c52bff932409149bb156000eac7ddc, type: 2}
    isQuestion: 0
  randomizeSentences: 1
  sentencesToUse: 5
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 33fb69851ac2bd14286543889ec6b54d, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
